  "body": "### Summary\nThe reader needs the topic page's 'remove flag' link to call LOT-051's `removeFlag(link:in:)`. No parser exposes it today, because LOT-033 left flag state out.\n\nScope: in the LOT-033 / LOT-031 area, parse the delflag link and the flag state from the topic page, using existing captures only. The state 'topic page with a flag, logged in' is already on LOT-033's pending-capture list.\n\nDepends on: LOT-033 (done), LOT-051 (PR #263).\n\nAcceptance criteria: differential tests on captures; any state that was not captured is listed as pending capture.",
